      <activity id="15732893-b230-5d50-b320-c529ae1a3ad1" activityNameId="c646ffc7-f3ae-531d-993c-1598158be176" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Scantling, softwood, average, at plant, with resource correction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Scantling, softwood, average, at plant, with resource correction
This is an average of massive and laminated scantling according to the use of scantling in four window manufactures in Switerland;
UUID: 040a10cf-ee88-3e07-9b5c-b017af5b53c0
Included are the materials used in a average scantling. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at scantling producers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: The corresponding dataset for Switzerland was used as basis. The electricity mix, wood inputs and transports were changed to account for production in Europe. Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_040a10cf-ee88-3e07-9b5c-b017af5b53c0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
